{"t":"meta","name":"wordcraft-1-chat-share","app":"wordcraft","schema":1,"format":1,"description":"Document chat in an encrypted room: a message left in the document before sharing (by the app's own user) seeds the room's chat; the peer's message, typing and the app's message travel encrypted; answering sync1; after leaving, the chat stays and new messages aren't sent."}
{"t":"note","text":"Outside a session the chat works as notes left in the file; nothing is sent."}
